WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.410 --> 00:00:06.800 align:start position:0%
 
[Music]  Nicki Minaj is back in a big way and  gracing the July 2018 cover of Elle  magazine inside the mag the rapper  shares she's had more personal growth in  the past six months then she's had in  the last eight years I feel like I'm the  king of the world  something she owes to being single for  the first time since she was 15 years  old quote as soon as I realized that I  could actually live and breathe and eat  and sleep and walk and talk without  having a boyfriend something clicked in  me  for the 35 year old being single makes  her feel strong and powerful the fact  that I am a young woman who doesn't need  a man for money  I don't need a man for a job I don't  have those pressures I get up when I  want shop when I want the  grammy-nominated rapper also opened up  about her ex boyfriend Meek Mill who at  the time of the interview was still  incarcerated for violating his probation  I know that when I went there pleading  for his freedom I know that the judge  spoke to me and was very sweet and  maternal and we both cried in her  chambers and she gave him another chance  in April Mill was released on bail after  the Pennsylvania Supreme Court ordered  his immediate release  [Music]  [Applause]

